            Paragraph(Text("The exact original telescope is D : LatticeData, H : Matrix (Fin D.rank) (Fin D.rank) Complex, h26 : D.rank = 26, hHG : H * gramComplex D = 1, and hGH : gramComplex D * H = 1. LatticeData retains its integral symmetric even form. The carrier is the existing physicalImage in the original global ker Q / range Q, with its literal descended-current bracket. Every original State primitive in both quotient slots is unrestricted.")),
