                H("Positive-root adjoint local nilpotence on every image element"), StatementSource.WithoutFormula(), AssessedProvenance.FromRepo(),
                Blocks(
                    Paragraph(Text("Source notation and complete enclosing context:\nimport D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTPhysicalCharacter\nimport D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTPhysicalLieSectors\nimport Batteries.Tactic.OpenPrivate\nimport Mathlib.Logic.Function.Iterate\nimport Mathlib.Tactic\n\nset_option autoImplicit false\nset_option relaxedAutoImplicit false\nset_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency true\nset_option maxRecDepth 4096\n\nnoncomputable section\nopen scoped BigOperators TensorProduct\n\nopen private project_physical physical_charge_representative from\n  D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTNeutralPhysicalCartan\nopen private chargeProject_mem from\n  D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTChargeCohomology\nopen private current_classOf from\n  D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.LatticeBRSTCohomologyBVSecondOrder\n\nnamespace D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTPositiveRootIntegrability\n\nopen LatticeGeneratingFieldLocality\nopen LatticeMatterGhostCoupling (State)\nopen LatticeSugawaraCurrents (gramComplex)\nopen LatticePositiveEnergy (chargeEnergy two_chargeEnergy)\nopen LatticeRelativeMassShell (fixedMomentum)\nopen LatticeQuartetContraction (chargeProject)\nopen D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTPhysicalLie\n  (physicalStates physicalStates_current physicalClass physicalImage)\nopen D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTPhysicalLieSectors\n  (current_charge)\nopen D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTChargeCohomology\n  (chargeSupport sum_chargeProject inclusion sectorCycles inclusion_sectorClassOf sectorClassOf)\nopen D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTPhysicalChargeFiber\n  (physicalChargeFiber)\nopen D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.Lattice.PhysicalLie.LatticeBRSTPhysicalCharacter\n  (physicalChargeFiber_eq_bot_of_level_neg)\nopen LatticeBRSTCohomologyField (Cohomology)\nopen D5.S3.VertexAlgebra.LatticeBRSTCohomologyBVSecondOrder\n  (cohomologyCurrent descentCurrent)\n\nvariable (D : LatticeData) (H : Matrix (Fin D.rank) (Fin D.rank) ℂ)\n  (h26 : D.rank = 26)\n  (hHG : H * gramComplex D = 1)\n  (hGH : gramComplex D * H = 1)\n\nlocal notation \"C\" => Cohomology D H h26 hHG hGH\nlocal notation \"Phys\" => physicalImage D H h26 hHG hGH\nlocal notation \"Fib\" => physicalChargeFiber D H h26 hHG hGH\n")),
                    Paragraph(Text("Exact theorem header through its outer assignment:\ntheorem positive_root_adjoint_locally_nilpotent\n    (alpha : Charge D) (hα : 0 < chargeEnergy D alpha)\n    (x : Phys) (hx : (x : C) ∈ Fib alpha) (y : Phys) :\n    ∃ N : ℕ, ((fun z : Phys => ⁅x, z⁆)^[N]) y = 0 := by\n")),
                    Paragraph(Text("The root bound is k(alpha,beta) = natAbs(bilinear beta alpha) + natAbs(chargeEnergy beta) + 3. Expansion of the actual integral bilinear, using LatticeActualGeneratorLocality.bilinear_add_right from LatticeActualProductKernel and the supplied bilinear_symmetric, gives q(beta+n alpha) = q(beta) + n bilinear(beta,alpha) + n^2 q(alpha). The existing two_chargeEnergy identity is applied to explicit charge arguments, without changing integral energy or assuming a real or positive-definite lattice. For q(alpha)>0 the bound makes terminal energy greater than one, so its charge is nonzero and its signed level is negative.")),
                    Paragraph(Text("Exact Batteries OpenPrivate access reuses project_physical, physical_charge_representative and chargeProject_mem, as well as current_classOf. The physical representative theorem consumes literal range inclusion membership from each original fiber. physicalStates_current preserves all four physical equations, current_charge tracks alpha+beta even at neutral output, and current_classOf is evaluated on the actual cycle subtypes. sectorClassOf and inclusion_sectorClassOf put this class in the existing global physical charge fiber. No replacement quotient, charge exclusion, pPlus or altered boundary space is used.")),
                    Paragraph(Text("Induction with Function.iterate_succ_apply' tracks beta+n alpha. At the literal root bound, physicalChargeFiber_eq_bot_of_level_neg is applied with the proved terminal-charge inequality p != 0, then bottom membership gives equality to zero. An arbitrary representative of y has finite original all-charge support. Its projected summands lie in physicalStates by project_physical; their finite sum is reconstructed in that subtype using its linear subtype inclusion and sum_chargeProject. Only then does the linear physicalClass map carry the sum to the quotient. The actual physicalImage subtype inclusion carries the resulting sum of physicalComponent elements.")),
                    Paragraph(Text("The installed Lie bracket gives the actual complex-linear adjoint A = LieModule.toEnd Complex Ph Ph x. An explicit equality of its underlying function with z -> [x,z] transports Module.End.pow_apply to bracket iteration. The generic finite-sum identity follows from map_sum for A^n, including an empty support. N is the finite supremum of the component bounds for this representative of y. For each supported beta, the proved killing power at k<=N is padded by the existing Module.End.pow_map_zero_of_le. This includes zero powers and uses no globally uniform exponent or nonempty-support hypothesis."))), DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Paragraph(Text("Source lineage: the sealed original candidate and the supplied original PhysicalLie/current, PhysicalLieSectors, ChargeCohomology, NeutralPhysicalCartan, PhysicalChargeFiber and PhysicalCharacter sources. Their lattice and current constructions retain Bakalov--Kac, Scott Carnahan and Kalle Kytölä attribution; their BRST constructions retain Becchi--Rouet--Stora--Tyutin, Kato--Ogawa and Lian--Zuckerman attribution. Mathlib and Batteries retain their own authorship and licenses. This repair claims no new literature attribution.")),
            Paragraph(Text("No positivity, realness, signature, unimodularity, perfectness, HPL-invariance or finite-dimensional whole-image assumption is added. This theorem supplies no Serre exponent, denominator identity, Monster recognition, convergence, full string formalization or AdS/CFT completion."))
